{"identifier":"facebook-478705756889549","title":"Obi-Wan Kenobi VS Kakashi (Star Wars VS Naruto) | Who Will Win?","description":"Two heroic mentors duke it out! Who do you think would win? #Maythe4th","videoUrl":"https://archive.org/download/facebook-478705756889549/478705756889549.mp4","thumbnailUrl":"https://archive.org/services/img/facebook-478705756889549","sourcePageUrl":"https://archive.org/details/facebook-478705756889549","durationMs":375000,"level":"C2","topic":"Facebook;video;","sourceCredit":"Source: Internet Archive — Obi-Wan Kenobi VS Kakashi (Star Wars VS Naruto) | Who Will Win?","hasCaptions":true,"segments":[{"startMs":10760,"endMs":12440,"text":"Another happy landing."},{"startMs":12440,"endMs":13080,"text":"Eh?"},{"startMs":13680,"endMs":14600,"text":"Hello there."},{"startMs":15600,"endMs":20240,"text":"Hold it. You're in Kanoha territory. I have some questions if you'll come with me."},{"startMs":22480,"endMs":25120,"text":"You want to go home and keep reading your book."},{"startMs":26040,"endMs":28880,"text":"I want to go home and keep reading my book."},{"startMs":29880,"endMs":31840,"text":"After I kick your ass!"},{"startMs":60200,"endMs":61440,"text":"Had enough?"},{"startMs":62440,"endMs":66360,"text":"Well now... you've fallen for the deadliest stratagem we ninja know..."},{"startMs":66960,"endMs":68920,"text":"1000 Years of Death."},{"startMs":69000,"endMs":84080,"text":"Don't try it. I have high gro--- I guess I have the high ground."},{"startMs":84920,"endMs":86880,"text":"Oh I don't think so."},{"startMs":103480,"endMs":105000,"text":"Most impressive."},{"startMs":106040,"endMs":107600,"text":"But I see you."},{"startMs":110840,"endMs":124120,"text":"Fire Style!"},{"startMs":142360,"endMs":145880,"text":"Be mindful of your thoughts, Obi-Wan... they betray you."},{"startMs":184560,"endMs":185800,"text":"Don't give up."},{"startMs":186760,"endMs":188160,"text":"Trust in the force."},{"startMs":190400,"endMs":208360,"text":"So uncivilized."},{"startMs":211600,"endMs":212240,"text":"K.O."},{"startMs":212520,"endMs":217720,"text":"Well, Kakashi may have been able to beat Obi-2, but he just couldn't beat \"Obi-One.\""},{"startMs":218400,"endMs":219600,"text":"Ha-ha, got 'em!"},{"startMs":219920,"endMs":226480,"text":"Kakashi's wide array of moves certainly kept Kenobi on his toes, but the Jedi's arsenal was far more powerful and versatile than you might think."},{"startMs":226480,"endMs":230720,"text":"Yeah! Like how chakkra is an internal life energy with a limited supply."},{"startMs":231040,"endMs":233360,"text":"But the force is external and everywhere!"},{"startMs":233360,"endMs":242880,"text":"Obi-Wan couldn't exactly run out of it, and Kakashi couldn't copy force techniques cause I mean, he's using external force, not internal chakkra. Totally different."},{"startMs":242880,"endMs":252440,"text":"As for brute power, ninja mountain busting and Annikan's dreadnought feat were fairly comparable, however, Kenobi matched Annikan's force power well after he had become far stronger than that."},{"startMs":253040,"endMs":262320,"text":"This is the chosen one we're talking about here! Other Jedi have done some crazy stuff, like throwing a fleat of star destroyers out of a solar system in seconds"},{"startMs":262320,"endMs":265120,"text":"and stopping a whole planet from going kaboom!"},{"startMs":265280,"endMs":270160,"text":"Oh, and you know how Obi-Wan tore apart Grievous's armor with his bare hands in Revenge of the Sith?"},{"startMs":270160,"endMs":274000,"text":"The same armor designed to survive starship canyons."},{"startMs":274040,"endMs":279080,"text":"It withstood a blast that annihilated a subterranean city and almost collapsed the surface of a planet."},{"startMs":279360,"endMs":285240,"text":"I seriously doubt that Obi is physically strong enough to rip that armor apart, but apparently the force is."},{"startMs":285240,"endMs":287760,"text":"Even kamui wasn't a reliable option."},{"startMs":287760,"endMs":295960,"text":"Since Kenobi's reaction speed was nearly 70,000 times faster than Kakashi's, more than quick enough to avoid kamui, especially with his precognition."},{"startMs":296040,"endMs":301920,"text":"But we can hear you shouting in the back, What about Kakashi's dual-mangekyo sharingan that Obito gave him?"},{"startMs":302000,"endMs":303560,"text":"And the perfect susanoo?"},{"startMs":303840,"endMs":308200,"text":"It's difficult to justify granting those to Kakashi at all because they aren't really his."},{"startMs":308480,"endMs":311720,"text":"He can only use them when Obito's spirit briefly possessed his body."},{"startMs":312040,"endMs":314640,"text":"Even if he did, the results probably wouldn't change much."},{"startMs":314640,"endMs":317000,"text":"Remember that Kyp guy who moved a black hole?"},{"startMs":317280,"endMs":321120,"text":"Yeah, he was directly compared to Obi-Wan by Luke himself."},{"startMs":321240,"endMs":328400,"text":"If we're to take that at face value, this means Kenobi could theoretically call upon the force to exert nearly 14 petatons of TNT."},{"startMs":328680,"endMs":330920,"text":"Way more than what Kakashi was packing."},{"startMs":331000,"endMs":336960,"text":"And, even then, Obi-Wan could just crush his organs. Shit, man, just don't mess around with Jedi."},{"startMs":337120,"endMs":344400,"text":"I know it can seem strange to hear about Jedi being this powerful and deadly, but think of it this way. Part of the reason why the Jedi code is so strict"},{"startMs":344680,"endMs":347600,"text":"is because of this immense power at their fingertips."},{"startMs":347920,"endMs":351640,"text":"The code tries to keep them uh... civilized in a way."},{"startMs":351960,"endMs":355600,"text":"But when you enter a Death Battle, throw those morals out the window."},{"startMs":355600,"endMs":359120,"text":"We're looking for who wins a no-holds-barred fight to the death."},{"startMs":359240,"endMs":367760,"text":"Kakashi had many impressive tools, tricks, and techniques, but Kenobi's brilliant speed, overwhelming force and greater level of power won this bout."},{"startMs":367760,"endMs":370040,"text":"In the end, Obi won."},{"startMs":370720,"endMs":373040,"text":"The winner is Obi-Wan Kenobi."},{"startMs":373360,"endMs":375000,"text":"From a certain point of view."}]}